WEBVTT

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:07.710
Please!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.150
Wait!

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.860
Stop right there!

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.670
No! Absolutely not!

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.530
Hey, you haven't heard anything.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:23.110
You're asking her to show up in your next game as backup, right?

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.240
How could you tell?

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.940
One look at that arm gives it away. {Rikka is Sherlock Holmes in her spare time. I like it.}

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.390
You're the softball team captain, Chiba, right?

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.940
You've got your hands full with your Precure and student council work.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.390
You can't just help everyone who comes along.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.090
But they're in big trouble.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.560
We sure are!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:47.000
Our next game will put us out of the preliminaries!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.270
Please!

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.040
I understand. Leave it to me.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.090
Huh?!

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.200
Thank you so much!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.960
Let's get you ready right away!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.300
Hold it, Mana!

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.440
You just need to learn the signals...

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:01.770
They're easy!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.400
Oh, forget it!

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:10.180
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:15.520
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:21.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:28.150
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:33.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:39.440
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:44.880
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:50.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:59.460
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:01.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.370
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.190
What's more than just cute

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:13.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:19.080
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:24.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:37.000
Awaken!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:37.000
Awaken!

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.920
That was fast!

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.410
It was more than fast.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:51.600
Her pitch had weight to it! {Yeah... the weight of the ball, right? Not like I pay attention in Physics, though...}

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:54.000
Why didn't we ever scout her?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.480
We tried!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.640
But you see...

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:57.870
What's wrong?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.110
The lace on my cleats snapped.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:04.600
I have some spare shoelace on me, so I'll lend you some!

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.290
Thanks, President!

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:10.020
She said she liked helping people more than clubs.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.040
I see.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:18.770
Kyouda!

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:21.680
Pick your jaw up off the ground! {She uses 見とれてない, which is sometimes used in a "falling in love" sense. This kinda captures that meaning, if clumsily.}

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.220
Come practice with us!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.050
Sure!

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.200
Maybe the President will join our team?

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:36.430
She's nice, but still cool...

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:37.520
Yeah!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:40.110
We'd be unstoppable with her pitching!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.470
Well, you're our future ace,

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.110
so get a few pointers!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.580
Hey, I'm not <i>that</i>...

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.610
I'm sorry! Can you throw it?

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:01.210
Thank you very much!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.930
I'm home!

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.170
Welcome.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.960
What? Why?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.850
Are you leaving me out?

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:19.710
You were busy with your team, right?

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:20.870
Oh, yeah...

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.480
I heard the news.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.570
You were scouted by a softball team, then?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:29.090
Yeah, they said they needed me.

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:32.080
The Happy Prince caves as quickly as ever.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.940
When is your game?

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.800
Next Sunday.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.220
It'll be at our school's field.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.630
I'll gladly come to cheer!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.460
For a team of newbies that puts the whole game on a helper's shoulders, sure.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.180
Are you angry?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.420
Why would I be?

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:51.200
I <i>only</i> have to fill in for you when picking up litter off campus,

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.150
setting up the wind instrument club's next recital,

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.670
and looking over club advertisements,

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.400
and I don't get angry at <i>that</i>.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.150
You're so kind, Miss Rikka!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.440
I love you!

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.610
Makopi's angry, too!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.320
We've gotten nowhere in the search for her queen!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.210
Huh?

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.600
I wouldn't say I'm angry, but...

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:11.190
But?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.000
I think it's strange.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.090
People only ask you to help out,

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:17.900
yet you take their requests so seriously.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.510
It's my number one rule!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.800
Besides, I'm happy to help others!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:32.140
Is helping others really so much fun?

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.780
Cure Heart?

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:34.550
Yeah.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:40.350
Didn't you sing for others back in Trump Kingdom?

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.360
You found joy in it, didn't you?

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.550
I'm not sure.

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:50.330
Then why not go cheer her on?

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.700
It might motivate you.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.280
It might.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.710
<i>Cure Heart...</i>

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:16.620
<i>I swear I'll return the favor!</i>

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.930
Don't blow a blood vessel, pops.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.950
They say to let sleeping dogs lie.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.400
So just let him lie.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:39.890
That'll do it!

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.310
President, what are you doing? {TL Note: Senpai means Kaichou}

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:46.280
All the uniforms were dirty, so I did some laundry!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.810
First years like us are supposed to do the chores!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.830
You're our backup!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.760
So spend your time practicing!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:58.690
Getting better on my own won't help the team.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.960
If you want to be regulars,

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:05.060
you've got to push each other and sharpen your skills together!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:08.510
That passion is what makes a team strong!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:09.870
Being first years...

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.840
is no excuse to hold back!

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.200
Uh, right!

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:15.690
If you get it, then get changed!

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:16.940
We're gonna jog!

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:17.680
Right!

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:22.190
They're getting into it. {Alt. "They're all mad hype."}

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.080
Guess it's because of our helper.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.770
I can't wait for tomorrow's game!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:27.580
Yeah.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:32.990
President!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.500
Good work today!

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:37.330
Same to you!

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.060
Good luck with tomorrow's game!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.370
Sure!

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.520
You're as popular as ever.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.350
Mister!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.110
And Ai too!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.980
You're a widdle sight for sore eyes!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:56.800
I ran out of powdered milk, so I'm going to buy some.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.390
Speaking of sights, look at you.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.850
What's with the sweats?

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.760
It's a long story...

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.230
Your softball team's in a tournament?

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:09.030
Yeah, and I'm their pitcher.

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.190
I see.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:13.370
Maybe Ai and I should come to cheer.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.330
Totally!

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:16.510
Oh yeah!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:22.180
Here's a charm to get Lady Luck on your side.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.790
Huh? You don't have to!

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.140
Oh, don't be shy.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:27.450
Oh!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.470
Hey now...

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.220
Oh dear.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.420
If you like it so much, I'll give it to you. {Wow, Ai jacked Mana's charm. Dick move.}

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.390
Good for you, Ai.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.460
Apologies for interrupting your heartwarming chat,

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.310
Aida Mana.

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:47.570
Or rather, Cure Heart.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.460
It's you!

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.480
Mana, be careful!

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.130
<i>I know that,</i>

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.350
<i>but I can't transform here!</i>

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.050
Let's settle this.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.210
I refuse!

00:08:57.210 --> 00:09:00.450
I don't have any reason to fight you!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:06.990
You babble such nonsense after seeing the ruins of Trump Kingdom first-hand?

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.040
Yeah, I saw it!

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:11.960
But beating you here won't bring that kingdom back!

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:14.740
You speak as though you've already won!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.360
Unacceptable!

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:22.040
Come now, transform into a Precure.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:24.510
Crushing you in your normal state

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:26.970
will bring no satisfaction.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.280
Look out!

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.080
Mister!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.380
Mister!

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.120
What a joke.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.480
It's not...

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.230
a joke!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.060
He wanted to save someone's life!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.460
He wanted to help someone!

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:46.100
Can't you understand that?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.480
Silence!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:52.900
Ai!

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.610
Ai!

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.970
If you want your baby back,

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:02.740
come to the Yotsuba Terminal at 8 AM tomorrow.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.450
Alone, of course.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.110
If you bring your allies...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.820
You can't!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:13.500
Ai...

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:17.000
Aiiiiiii!

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.570
What happened?

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.210
Why hasn't it started?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.700
Good morning.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.110
Alice...

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.270
Oh?

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.050
The game hasn't begun?

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:46.190
Well, you see...

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:47.390
She's late!

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.360
What's the President doing?

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:52.660
I called her home, but she apparently already left.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.490
Geez!

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:55.170
This is <i>not</i> the time for sightseeing!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.670
Oogai Hospital

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.670
Oogai Hospital

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.670
m 346 199 l 303 255 l 302 344 l 315 345 l 793 179 l 805 130 l 800 45 l 772 31 l 734 43

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.520
Me, of all people...

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:08.250
This is a trap, my sweet heart.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.580
You can't go!

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.590
You came alone, as promised.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:23.730
How bold of you.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.410
Where's Ai?

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.970
Ai!

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.270
And, as promised, I'll return her.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.240
But only if you beat me.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.710
Let's go, Charles!

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.510
Charles!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.800
Precure Love Link!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:48.470
L-O-V-E!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.120
L-O-V-E!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:49.800
L-O-V-E!

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:50.760
L-O-V-E!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:24.760
Oh you extremely selfish old man,

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.040
I, Cure Heart,

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:30.140
will take Ai back once more!

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.130
Excellent.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.160
Well?

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.330
Can you call Charles?

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:36.980
We're trying to...

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.300
But there's no response.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:41.610
Please, wait just a little longer!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.810
I know how you feel,

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.890
but if you can't gather your team,

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.010
you'll be disqualified automatically.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.640
B-But...

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.010
We can't do it without the Pres!

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.220
We can't win!

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:54.690
<i>I can see why they're panicking.</i>

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:58.690
<i>They've lost the one person they relied on the most.</i>

00:12:58.690 --> 00:12:59.920
Captain!

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:02.190
Let me pitch!

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:02.790
Kyouda?

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:06.440
The President taught us something.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:10.730
As long as we work together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.960
I'm sure the President has her reasons for not coming.

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.770
So let us fight in her place! {Oh, の分まで again. You're not screwing me up this time.}

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.740
I see.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.100
Let's give 'em all we've got!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.110
Thank you very much!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.320
Play ball!

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.570
Madam.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:43.960
Strike!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.170
What's wrong?

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:57.010
Getting tired?

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.820
I knew it was a trap!

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:13.030
You coward!

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:16.640
That's the highest praise a Selfish can receive.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:23.980
Look out!

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:25.750
Now, sparkle!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:26.880
Twinkle Diamond!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.320
What?!

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.420
Why are you here?

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.980
Sebastian searched for you.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:40.860
Even an MVP can't win on her own!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:44.400
We're a team after all, so have a little faith!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:45.820
You girls...

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:50.290
The softball team's doing their best in your stead, {Am I seriously going with this?}

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.410
so let's do <i>our</i> best, too! {I guess I am.}

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.090
Everyone's doing what they can...

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:57.240
Yeah!

00:14:58.430 --> 00:14:59.230
Let's go!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.050
All right!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.980
Brimming with love,

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:08.180
Cure Heart!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.630
The light of wisdom,

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.890
Cure Diamond!

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.150
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.520
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.680
The blade of courage,

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.730
Cure Sword!

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:35.640
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.340
Dokidoki Precure!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.720
I have more tricks up my sleeve.

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:44.740
That's...

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:46.060
A Dark Psyche!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:53.530
Grant me your darkness!

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:02.290
Did he just do that?

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.780
What's happening to him?

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:13.300
I consumed concentrated selfishness to power myself up!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.290
I am now Bel Beast!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.540
Wow...

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:17.530
That's a...

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.370
How shall I put it?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.260
It's complicated...

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.120
Don't think I'm weak, else I'll knock ya into next week! {This line is actually a dope rhyme.}

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.900
Snapshot.

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:27.710
Too bright!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.370
Cure Sword!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:41.810
Silent Mode Vibration!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.610
You've got mail!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:51.860
He's strong!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.010
But we can't lose.

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.320
Not until we take Ai back!

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.650
From me to you,

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:08.870
My Sweet Heart!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.240
She did it!

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:15.750
I told you.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.650
Don't think I'm weak.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.130
What are you thinking?

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.030
Did you forget?

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.440
I said to come alone.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.640
It's punishment for breaking your promise.

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:42.040
Ai has nothing to do with this!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.180
Stop it!

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.080
Hasta la vista, baby.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.000
Stop it!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.360
Kyupirappa!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.830
Wh-What?!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.100
That light!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.560
A Lovies?

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.900
It's a new power!

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:21.310
Love Heart Arrow! {I assume they know the name of it because they watched the toy advert for this during the CM break.}

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.360
This is...

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:26.540
Use the Lovies!

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.660
Curse you!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.380
Take this!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:40.510
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.210
What?!

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.420
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:10.850
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:16.590
Now's your chance, Cure Heart!

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.610
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:52.430
Huh?

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:53.420
What was I... {Don't text and drive.}

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.520
Ai!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.640
Thank goodness!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:00.540
Yeah!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.250
So that brat...

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.370
can make miracles, huh?

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.070
Curses, I'll remember this!

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:14.230
Oh Ai, thank goodness!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:16.760
Ai!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.400
How is it?

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.930
Top of the ninth.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:24.670
Touei

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:24.670
Oogai

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:25.600
We're up by one run!

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.570
They have two outs, but the bases are loaded!

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.140
Ball!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:34.320
Another ball will tie it up,

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:36.300
and a hit will turn the game around!

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.350
You can do it, Kyouda!

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.590
I know you've got it in you!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:07.370
Strike!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.970
Batter out!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.330
Game set!

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:12.830
We did it!

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:14.840
We won!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.200
Congrats!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.950
I know a simple apology won't cut it,

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.600
but I'm really sorry!

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:27.070
Geez, we never thought for a moment you wouldn't show up.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.130
Sorry.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:31.470
But this week made me realize something.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.840
You can't rely solely on others.

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:38.910
But if we all believe in ourselves and work together,

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.660
we can overcome any challenge!

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:44.540
That's what you taught me!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.080
Thank you so much!

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:53.430
If you work together, you can overcome any challenge...

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:57.550
It seems that the whole team has taken Mana's lesson to heart.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.760
<i>I'll fight with everyone.</i>

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:02.560
<i>Until the day I find my queen...</i>

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:09.210
Mana has a disciple?

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:10.940
Yeah, his name's Jun!

00:22:10.940 --> 00:22:12.780
He's a real fighter!

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:13.740
I'm worried...

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:14.210
About what?

00:22:14.550 --> 00:22:17.450
I know there are plenty of kids that respect Mana, but...

00:22:17.450 --> 00:22:19.720
Mana's life is no stroll in the park.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:21.690
I worry for anyone tagging along.

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:22.290
Huh?

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:25.520
Wh-What kind of life does Mana lead?

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:28.230
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:31.560
Mana's Determination!

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:31.560
Mana's Determination!

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:34.060
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
